<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Online Classroom</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #eef4ff;
        }

        header {
            background: #303f9f;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>💻 My Online Classroom</h1>
    <p>Learn • Practice • Improve</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📚 Today's Lesson</h2>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Web Development</p>
        <p><strong>Topic:</strong> Introduction to HTML</p>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 Hour</p>
        <button>View Lesson</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📝 Today's Assignment</h2>
        <p>Create a simple webpage using headings, paragraphs and lists.</p>
        <p><strong>Deadline:</strong> Friday</p>
        <button>View Assignment</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📢 Classroom Announcement</h2>
        <p>
            The next practical session will focus on creating
            your first complete HTML webpage.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
